use language/def
use entry

// Arguments are written A0 followed by a number (X0, X1, ...), from here to the end of the file. Each file starts with A.
// Example: argument is X
//          → `python X0 times X1` is a definition with two arguments (not checked)
statement argument
    words argument is A0
    does in def[written]
        set argument name to A0
